  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Perception — camera only",
      "items": [
        "Qwen3-VL-8B does recognition and 2D grounding in one pass; no separate detector runs in the live path.",
        "Part XYZ comes from /api/project_to_world depth ray-casting — USD is read only for the static bin and tray."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Motion — staged skills",
      "items": [
        "cuMotion plans transit against GPU spheres from AIKIDO.xrdf; descent is a constrained Cartesian move.",
        "Corner-camera point clouds build the obstacle world with /World/gantry filtered out, so the arm is not its own obstacle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Isaac Sim boundary",
      "items": [
        "The bridge is exec'd in the Isaac Sim Script Editor — it shares the simulator process, not the operator venv.",
        "Its HTTP thread never touches USD; every mutation is queued and drained by the simulation main loop."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Trust, state and evidence",
      "items": [
        "Only whitelisted actions cross the boundary — never joint angles or torques; plans over 50 steps are truncated.",
        "kitting.db holds parts and kits; eval.db plus per-session JSONL record perception, pick, place and task events."
      ]
    }
  ]
